{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:93B23DB0F67B",
  "root": "u6",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 66,
      "text": "Students taking classes from home is a advantage and\u00a0disadvantage.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 67,
      "end": 124,
      "text": "Because most of the students don't pass the online class,",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 125,
      "end": 230,
      "text": "its hard for students to understand, what the teacher is talking about when talking through a video call.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 231,
      "end": 296,
      "text": "But most of the parents cant afford to send their kids to school,",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 297,
      "end": 331,
      "text": "so the kids gotta learn from home.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "start": 332,
      "end": 402,
      "text": "Goin to school learn is the best way, so the teacher can explain them.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 403,
      "end": 475,
      "text": "The advantage is teachers stay after school for extra help for students.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 476,
      "end": 521,
      "text": "Most teachers come home, and teaches student.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 522,
      "end": 573,
      "text": "The parents can watch what their child is learning.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 574,
      "end": 626,
      "text": "So my paragragh is about disadvantage and advantage.",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 628,
      "end": 680,
      "text": "The students stay home and learn from their parents.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 681,
      "end": 759,
      "text": "If you live in a village in parts of Asia they have small school for students,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 760,
      "end": 773,
      "text": "they are free",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 774,
      "end": 805,
      "text": "but their education isn't good.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 806,
      "end": 887,
      "text": "Parents don't have enough money to send their kids to school with good education.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 888,
      "end": 954,
      "text": "The small schools that are free doesn't offer that much education.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 955,
      "end": 1033,
      "text": "Students just stay home and let parents teaches watever or how much they know.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 1034,
      "end": 1126,
      "text": "The schools that are free, the environment isnt good, the teachers arent that much educated.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u20",
      "start": 1128,
      "end": 1207,
      "text": "The advantage is most of the teachers come home, and teaches students for free.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u21",
      "start": 1208,
      "end": 1258,
      "text": "Because they understand their parents cant afford.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u22",
      "start": 1259,
      "end": 1344,
      "text": "If students go to school and if they need extra help, teachers can stay after school.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u24",
      "start": 1345,
      "end": 1403,
      "text": "There are public schools in USA that offer free education.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u25",
      "start": 1404,
      "end": 1472,
      "text": "The students can learn a lot from school more than learning at home.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u26",
      "start": 1473,
      "end": 1552,
      "text": "In most part of the countries some good schools take a test what students know,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u27",
      "start": 1553,
      "end": 1617,
      "text": "if they pass the Government pays the expensive for the students.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u28",
      "start": 1618,
      "end": 1645,
      "text": "It is a very big advantage.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u29",
      "start": 1647,
      "end": 1705,
      "text": "So taking classes online or going to school are both good.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u30",
      "start": 1706,
      "end": 1788,
      "text": "Beacuse education is very important, going to school is best way to get education.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u31",
      "start": 1789,
      "end": 1834,
      "text": "Because what the school teaches nobody can't.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
